        "heading_RMqNcD": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Types of Unscented Candles",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "border_yzk8QB": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_BNfhHV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We offer a brilliant selection of unscented candles to suit any setting. All are free of fragrance, but full of warm ambiance. They're ideal for creating a welcoming, neutral atmosphere at weddings, restaurants, religious ceremonies, or in homes with scent sensitivities. Choose from multiple sizes and colors to match your décor or event theme. Here are the types we have on hand:</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_YbKmgU": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "text_bergHm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Pillar Candles:</strong> Thick, freestanding <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/pillar-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">pillar candles</span></a> burn for hours and add a timeless touch to centerpieces, mantels, and event décor.</li><li><strong>Taper Candles:</strong> Long and slender with a graceful profile, <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">taper candles</span></a> are ideal for candelabras and formal table settings.</li><li><strong>Votive Candles:</strong> Small but powerful <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/votive-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">votive candles</span></a> are perfect for glass holders and create a soft, cozy ambiance.</li><li><strong>Floating Candles:</strong> Designed to glow in a pool of water, <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/floating-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">floating candles</span></a> bring a magical touch to bowls, fountains, and decorative displays.</li><li><strong>Tealight Candles:</strong> Compact and versatile, <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/tealights\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">tealights</span></a> make great accent lighting. They're also used beneath warming dishes or inside lanterns and holders.</li></ul>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_FHCCUt": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "heading_LciEqx": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Benefits of Bolsius Candles From Kisco",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_hVyHHc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>There's a reason so many customers trust us for unscented candles – they're clean-burning and mess-free, but also long-lasting and thoughtfully designed. Bolsius candles are crafted to burn evenly without pooling, dripping, or producing excess smoke, making them a reliable choice for both practical and decorative use – and a planet-friendly solution.</p><p>When it comes to safety, Bolsius doesn't cut corners. Their unscented candles are made without harsh additives, making them safer for pets, children, and people with allergies or respiratory sensitivities. If you're planning an event where aroma-free ambiance is essential – or just want to keep things simple at home – our unscented candles offer peace of mind and a timeless glow.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_jmAgWL": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 36
          }
        },
        "heading_BeiVzC": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why Choose Kisco Candles?",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "text_phjRjn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We keep things simple: high-quality unscented candles, ready when you need them, in the quantities that make sense. At Kisco, we focus on reliable service, fast shipping, and stocking the candles you actually want. Whether you're planning a large-scale event or just prefer to keep your home stocked with no-fuss, odorless candles, we're here to help you get glowing!</p><p>Our team knows candles inside and out, and we're always happy to guide you to the right fit. <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/wholesale-bulk-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Bulk ordering</span></a>? Last-minute needs? No problem! </p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
