        "heading_MrGjAB": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Frequently Asked Questions About Unscented Candles",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "border_JMAjFR": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_phgQQw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Below, we've addressed a few questions about Bolsius unscented candles. Please <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/pages/contact-us\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">contact us</span></a> for additional information.  </p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_6THxWy": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_jRWLhL": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why use scentless candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_cVFhCr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Scentless candles provide soft, ambient light without introducing undue fragrance to the space. They're perfect for dinner tables, religious ceremonies, and events where scent could clash with food or cause irritation.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_ykeVbb": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_fVaWkq": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What can you do with odorless candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_xVMDY7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>From romantic dinners to peaceful meditations, odorless candles are versatile. Use them to decorate your space, set the mood, or add an extra touch of elegance without worrying about overwhelming scents.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_68L9WH": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_63Jihh": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Which is better: unscented or fragrance-free candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_dttHE3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The terms are often used interchangeably, but there's a slight difference. Fragrance-free candles are made without any added scent or masking agents. Unscented candles may still have a subtle natural wax smell but no noticeable fragrance. Both types are great for sensitive environments.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_zbiA3h": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        }
